{"lines": [{"start": 3, "end": 133, "text": "2 prompts built this pricing calculator. No code. You never touch it.", "words": [{"w": "2", "s": 6, "e": 10}, {"w": "prompts", "s": 13, "e": 25}, {"w": "built", "s": 25, "e": 32}, {"w": "this", "s": 32, "e": 38}, {"w": "pricing", "s": 38, "e": 48}, {"w": "calculator.", "s": 48, "e": 64}, {"w": "No", "s": 80, "e": 83}, {"w": "code.", "s": 83, "e": 92}, {"w": "You", "s": 104, "e": 107}, {"w": "never", "s": 107, "e": 118}, {"w": "touch", "s": 118, "e": 126}, {"w": "it.", "s": 126, "e": 132}]}, {"start": 139, "end": 252, "text": "First try. And neither prompt asks AI to build anything.", "words": [{"w": "First", "s": 142, "e": 151}, {"w": "try.", "s": 151, "e": 162}, {"w": "And", "s": 173, "e": 179}, {"w": "neither", "s": 179, "e": 186}, {"w": "prompt", "s": 186, "e": 199}, {"w": "asks", "s": 199, "e": 210}, {"w": "AI", "s": 210, "e": 219}, {"w": "to", "s": 219, "e": 228}, {"w": "build", "s": 228, "e": 236}, {"w": "anything.", "s": 236, "e": 248}]}, {"start": 261, "end": 364, "text": "Prompt one wants a build plan: one task per number.", "words": [{"w": "Prompt", "s": 264, "e": 271}, {"w": "one", "s": 271, "e": 277}, {"w": "wants", "s": 283, "e": 292}, {"w": "a", "s": 292, "e": 298}, {"w": "build", "s": 298, "e": 303}, {"w": "plan:", "s": 303, "e": 314}, {"w": "one", "s": 323, "e": 331}, {"w": "task", "s": 331, "e": 341}, {"w": "per", "s": 341, "e": 350}, {"w": "number.", "s": 350, "e": 359}]}, {"start": 369, "end": 461, "text": "If a number hides two jobs, it has to split it.", "words": [{"w": "If", "s": 372, "e": 377}, {"w": "a", "s": 377, "e": 381}, {"w": "number", "s": 381, "e": 387}, {"w": "hides", "s": 387, "e": 396}, {"w": "two", "s": 396, "e": 408}, {"w": "jobs,", "s": 408, "e": 423}, {"w": "it", "s": 431, "e": 435}, {"w": "has", "s": 435, "e": 442}, {"w": "to", "s": 442, "e": 448}, {"w": "split", "s": 448, "e": 456}, {"w": "it.", "s": 456, "e": 461}]}, {"start": 467, "end": 651, "text": "So \"add ingredients\" became four: price paid, pack size, amount used, then the cost.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 470, "e": 479}, {"w": "\"add", "s": 479, "e": 493}, {"w": "ingredients\"", "s": 493, "e": 504}, {"w": "became", "s": 504, "e": 520}, {"w": "four:", "s": 520, "e": 534}, {"w": "price", "s": 550, "e": 550}, {"w": "paid,", "s": 550, "e": 559}, {"w": "pack", "s": 576, "e": 577}, {"w": "size,", "s": 577, "e": 588}, {"w": "amount", "s": 599, "e": 605}, {"w": "used,", "s": 605, "e": 619}, {"w": "then", "s": 628, "e": 634}, {"w": "the", "s": 634, "e": 639}, {"w": "cost.", "s": 639, "e": 645}]}, {"start": 657, "end": 743, "text": "Forty-four steps, each doing one job.", "words": [{"w": "Forty-four", "s": 660, "e": 668}, {"w": "steps,", "s": 675, "e": 689}, {"w": "each", "s": 705, "e": 708}, {"w": "doing", "s": 708, "e": 719}, {"w": "one", "s": 719, "e": 729}, {"w": "job.", "s": 729, "e": 740}]}, {"start": 751, "end": 979, "text": "It even caught a pricing mistake most people make: a 30% margin means dividing by 0.7, not adding 30%.", "words": [{"w": "It", "s": 754, "e": 759}, {"w": "even", "s": 759, "e": 765}, {"w": "caught", "s": 765, "e": 771}, {"w": "a", "s": 771, "e": 776}, {"w": "pricing", "s": 776, "e": 786}, {"w": "mistake", "s": 786, "e": 797}, {"w": "most", "s": 797, "e": 806}, {"w": "people", "s": 806, "e": 814}, {"w": "make:", "s": 814, "e": 825}, {"w": "a", "s": 834, "e": 836}, {"w": "30%", "s": 836, "e": 845}, {"w": "margin", "s": 854, "e": 866}, {"w": "means", "s": 866, "e": 873}, {"w": "dividing", "s": 873, "e": 885}, {"w": "by", "s": 885, "e": 893}, {"w": "0.7,", "s": 893, "e": 914}, {"w": "not", "s": 935, "e": 942}, {"w": "adding", "s": 942, "e": 956}, {"w": "30%.", "s": 956, "e": 978}]}, {"start": 989, "end": 1079, "text": "But that plan is written for you, not for the AI.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 992, "e": 997}, {"w": "that", "s": 997, "e": 1004}, {"w": "plan", "s": 1004, "e": 1011}, {"w": "is", "s": 1011, "e": 1016}, {"w": "written", "s": 1016, "e": 1021}, {"w": "for", "s": 1021, "e": 1028}, {"w": "you,", "s": 1028, "e": 1038}, {"w": "not", "s": 1049, "e": 1055}, {"w": "for", "s": 1055, "e": 1061}, {"w": "the", "s": 1061, "e": 1064}, {"w": "AI.", "s": 1064, "e": 1072}]}, {"start": 1088, "end": 1187, "text": "Prompt two turns it into orders for a coding assistant.", "words": [{"w": "Prompt", "s": 1091, "e": 1100}, {"w": "two", "s": 1100, "e": 1107}, {"w": "turns", "s": 1114, "e": 1126}, {"w": "it", "s": 1126, "e": 1131}, {"w": "into", "s": 1131, "e": 1139}, {"w": "orders", "s": 1139, "e": 1148}, {"w": "for", "s": 1148, "e": 1159}, {"w": "a", "s": 1159, "e": 1163}, {"w": "coding", "s": 1163, "e": 1171}, {"w": "assistant.", "s": 1171, "e": 1182}]}, {"start": 1192, "end": 1294, "text": "Nothing merged. Nothing skipped. Nothing reordered.", "words": [{"w": "Nothing", "s": 1195, "e": 1205}, {"w": "merged.", "s": 1205, "e": 1219}, {"w": "Nothing", "s": 1233, "e": 1239}, {"w": "skipped.", "s": 1239, "e": 1252}, {"w": "Nothing", "s": 1268, "e": 1274}, {"w": "reordered.", "s": 1274, "e": 1289}]}, {"start": 1303, "end": 1476, "text": "I pasted that into Claude. It built this, tested its own math, and fixed a rounding bug by itself.", "words": [{"w": "I", "s": 1306, "e": 1311}, {"w": "pasted", "s": 1311, "e": 1322}, {"w": "that", "s": 1322, "e": 1326}, {"w": "into", "s": 1326, "e": 1332}, {"w": "Claude.", "s": 1332, "e": 1343}, {"w": "It", "s": 1354, "e": 1358}, {"w": "built", "s": 1358, "e": 1364}, {"w": "this,", "s": 1364, "e": 1374}, {"w": "tested", "s": 1382, "e": 1389}, {"w": "its", "s": 1389, "e": 1397}, {"w": "own", "s": 1397, "e": 1404}, {"w": "math,", "s": 1404, "e": 1414}, {"w": "and", "s": 1422, "e": 1423}, {"w": "fixed", "s": 1423, "e": 1430}, {"w": "a", "s": 1430, "e": 1436}, {"w": "rounding", "s": 1436, "e": 1445}, {"w": "bug", "s": 1445, "e": 1454}, {"w": "by", "s": 1454, "e": 1460}, {"w": "itself.", "s": 1460, "e": 1468}]}, {"start": 1483, "end": 1643, "text": "The example cake: 58.52 euros to make, 83.59 to sell.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 1486, "e": 1493}, {"w": "example", "s": 1493, "e": 1503}, {"w": "cake:", "s": 1503, "e": 1514}, {"w": "58.52", "s": 1514, "e": 1534}, {"w": "euros", "s": 1553, "e": 1560}, {"w": "to", "s": 1560, "e": 1568}, {"w": "make,", "s": 1568, "e": 1579}, {"w": "83.59", "s": 1579, "e": 1600}, {"w": "to", "s": 1622, "e": 1631}, {"w": "sell.", "s": 1631, "e": 1639}]}, {"start": 1653, "end": 1759, "text": "DM me PROMPT and I'll send you both prompts, word for word.", "words": [{"w": "DM", "s": 1656, "e": 1665}, {"w": "me", "s": 1665, "e": 1671}, {"w": "PROMPT", "s": 1671, "e": 1680}, {"w": "and", "s": 1689, "e": 1692}, {"w": "I'll", "s": 1692, "e": 1696}, {"w": "send", "s": 1696, "e": 1701}, {"w": "you", "s": 1701, "e": 1707}, {"w": "both", "s": 1707, "e": 1713}, {"w": "prompts,", "s": 1713, "e": 1726}, {"w": "word", "s": 1740, "e": 1742}, {"w": "for", "s": 1742, "e": 1748}, {"w": "word.", "s": 1748, "e": 1756}]}], "end": 1759, "total": 1789}